		<strong>tourism in Brazil</strong>: destinations, itineraries, nature, beaches, historic
		towns, gastronomy and practical travel advice for international visitors.
	</p>

	<p>
		From the Iguaçu Falls to the Amazon, from Rio de Janeiro's skyline to the colonial streets of
